        {
          "topic": "Disability Justice and Wages",
          "value": "Ensure that all disabled people are paid fairly, and end the loopholes that allow businesses to pay disabled people subminimum wages. Expand and reform Social Security Disability Insurance (SSDI) and Supplemental Security Income (SSI), so that people receiving benefits can actually survive on them and end the punitive regulations that trap disabled people into poverty.",
